{"id":"275a460122ba5530","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-arithmetical-truth.md","title":"Arithmetical Truth","display":"df-arithmetical-truth — Arithmetical Truth","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-arithmetical-truth","aliases":["92-df-arithmetical-truth"],"display":"df-arithmetical-truth — Arithmetical Truth","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-sentence]]"],"source":"第 X 章 p. 114（PDF 131）；跳跃分类为本地递归论补充","source_status":"原书真码集合的本地呈现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-arithmetical-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-arithmetical-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-truth — Arithmetical Truth"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 X 章 p. 114（PDF 131）；跳跃分类为本地递归论补充"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书真码集合的本地呈现"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-arithmetical-truth-—-Arithmetical-Truth-$\\mathrm{True}_\\mathbb{N}$\">df-arithmetical-truth — Arithmetical Truth <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{True}_\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{True}_\\mathbb{N}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (Gödel code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\)</span> (external arithmetic truth, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TrueCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TrueCode}_G\\)</span> (definition-target code predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}truth} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{TrueCode}_G(n)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\bigl(n=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\land\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}truth} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{TrueCode}_G(n)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\bigl(n=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\land\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TrueCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TrueCode}_G\\)</span>：标准模型中为真的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-句子的外部码谓词；非法句子码自动不满足它</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{N} \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathfrak{N} \\models \\varphi\\)</span> : 标准模型的满足关系</li>\n<li>作为另外的递归论背景，在固定有效句码下，真算术码集与有限跳跃有效直和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0^{(\\omega)}\">\\(\\mathbf0^{(\\omega)}\\)</span> Turing 等价，故为轻体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^1_1\">\\(\\Delta^1_1\\)</span>；原书没有建立这套跳跃记号模型，不能把该复杂度说明当作本定义的直接依赖</li>\n<li>Tarski定理：没有算术公式可以定义算术真理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书明确每个固定度数的真/假码集算术可表达，完整真码集不算术可表达，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"640a7b260804a3a0\" href=\"?note=640a7b260804a3a0\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth\">92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth</a>。本定义不预设完整真值在一阶算术中有可用的对象语言谓词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-arithmetical-truth-—-Arithmetical-Truth-$\\mathrm{True}_\\mathbb{N}$","text":"df-arithmetical-truth — Arithmetical Truth $\\mathrm{True}_\\mathbb{N}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G$ (external arithmetic truth, see [[92-df-arithmetic-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence set, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ (Gödel numbering, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth","status":"resolved","id":"640a7b260804a3a0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书明确每个固定度数的真/假码集算术可表达，完整真码集不算术可表达，见 [[92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth]]。本定义不预设完整真值在一阶算术中有可用的对象语言谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{True}_\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TrueCode}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}truth} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{TrueCode}_G(n)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\bigl(n=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\land\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TrueCode}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{N} \\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0^{(\\omega)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta^1_1","display":false}],"bytes":1832,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetical-truth]]"}],"outgoing":["482ac6c3f68b4b5b","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","90f32e29c9d553ed","640a7b260804a3a0"]}